- PRD (Product requirements document)

- Pull from queue list of EmbeddingQueueItem(msg_id, job_id, product)
- each item (workflow)
    - set job status as processing -> usando el job_id
    - generate captions 
        - por cada image_url in product.image_urls si no existe en base de datos (usar hash de la url)
            - generar caption
            - on complete -> guardar en base de datos
    - generate description
    - on fail -> mark job as failed
    - on success -> guardar en base de datos y agregar a los results del workflow
    - on complete -> borrar de la cola

- generate embeddings de las descripciones de producto que que no hayan fallado
    - save embeddings
- mark jobs all remaining as success
- delete all remaining jobs